00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:06.670
Th-thank you very much! It's a first date with Yuuto-san.

00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:10.100
First? Then what about the ones before...?

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.550
W-well you see, according to Mika...

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:23.890
Okay, onee-chan. Events, Natsu-Comic, and shopping at Akiba is not a date, it's just a hang out. Okay!? H-a-n-g-o-u-t!

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:29.830
That's what she told me, so this is my first date with Yuuto-san.

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:31.120
R-really...

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:32.880
Yes!

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:35.120
First date, huh...?

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:39.660
I'm getting kind of nervous actually hearing the word...

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:14.500
