00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:42.510
Uh, yeah...something similar for me too...

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.070
te-teehee!

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:46.580
We've clicked pretty nicely.

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:47.720
Huh!?

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:50.430
uh...um...

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:53.590
Uh, um...

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:59.310
Y-you look even cuter than usual, so...

00:03:59.380 --> 00:03:59.930
Huh...!?

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:04.760
N-no... Yuuto-san, too, kind of look a little different from usual and...

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:07.170
um... handsome.

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:07.740
