00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:29.720
Oh, you know, we saw her at the New Year's temple visit.

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:33.240
Ah, from that time.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:40.480
The other day, I bumped into her on my way home from school and that's when she gave me these tickets to the amusement park.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:43.190
W-we had a lot left at the office, so... 

