00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:52.880
Da-date!

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:52.880
Da-date!

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.220
Isn't it kind of hot here...?

00:04:58.490 --> 00:04:59.090
Yeah...

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:02.920
Uh, um...Why are you two here, Kayahara-san?

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:03.490
