00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:09.540
Yeah...

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:13.160
Well~ Alright, Nogizaka-san, it's your turn~

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:14.580
Y-yes.

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:20.620
Oh, there, make sure to fix the direction of the light.

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:22.740
It creates a shadow on Nogizaka-san if it's right there.

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:23.690
I'm sorry.

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:27.650
Isn't that a little too different from mine...?

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:29.920
Okay, look this way, please~

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:30.850
Huh?

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:32.610
Pull your chin in, please.

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:33.900
Uh, um...

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:39.500
Nogizaka-san, it'd be nice if we could get a little more of a relaxed expression.

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:41.420
Y-yes.

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:43.710
L-like this...?

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:45.430
Uh, um~

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:49.620
I mean, if you could smile a little more naturally...

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:52.250
L-like this?

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:54.090
Hmm...

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:56.090
We'll take a short break~

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:57.300
Oh, okay.

00:15:57.510 --> 00:15:59.290
What can we do about this?

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:04.180
I think since the actual material is good, it'll work even if she looks a little nervous.

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:10.810
But then to attract more people, it's better to have the best expression.

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:13.720
Good job. That was tough.

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:15.280
Y-yes.

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:18.290
Y-yes. I was kind of really nervous.

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:19.500
Haruka...

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:20.880
are you okay?

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:21.560
Huh?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:24.500
If you don't feel like it, you don't have to force yourself.

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:28.850
I'm okay. I'm not forcing myself.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:29.930
But...

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:35.800
It's true that I get nervous, but you don't get to experience this type of thing that often, and...

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:42.740
Also... if I could get pictures of Yuuto-san and me together at our first date...

00:16:36.130 --> 00:16:37.380
Oh...!

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:46.030
I thought it would be the best "souvenir"...

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:47.090
Haruka...

00:16:47.390 --> 00:16:49.690
So I'm having lots of fun.

00:16:49.890 --> 00:16:52.070
I'm not forcing myself at all.

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:53.090
Cameraman!

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:53.850
Yes?

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:56.520
This is our chance, now! Shutter-chance!

00:16:56.520 --> 00:16:59.230
Nogizaka-san has a great smile right now.

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:01.140
But, the boyfriend's going to be in it.

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:02.530
It's okay! I'll take care of it later!

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:03.230
O-okay...

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:06.500
Oh, this is great.

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:10.020
This is Nogizaka-san's real smile...

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:11.090
But...

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:15.990
Nogizaka-san has the best smile when she's with Ayase-kun, huh?

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:19.250
That kind of bothers me a little, but...

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:28.190
It's so nice of them to take such pretty pictures...

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:31.330
Now I have another precious memory.

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:32.410
I'm happy for you.

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:34.780
Well then, which one do you want to go on next?

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:38.980
Well, but...it's kind of getting late, so maybe just one more?

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:42.330
You're right. It's a shame, but...

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:43.880
What do you want to ride?

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:45.320
I'm up for anything.

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:47.050
Um...

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:49.050
Oh, I want that one.

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:50.360
Ferris wheel, huh...?

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:51.230
Yes.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:56.310
According to the guide, the night view is very beautiful and perfect for a date, so.

00:17:56.500 --> 00:17:58.470
I see, alright.

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:02.140
Let's go, then.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:03.300
Oh...

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:06.760
mm... yes!

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:16.290
Wow... it's so beautiful...

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:18.960
The entire city is sparkling.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:21.100
Hm?

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:23.100
Yuuto-san, what's wrong?

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:25.340
Oh, uh, n-nothing.

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:29.180
Oh...Yuuto-san, you're lips are bleeding. Are you alright?

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:32.270
Oh...it probably got dry and cracked.

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:33.900
It's nothing, don't worry.

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:35.560
It-it's not okay!

00:18:35.110 --> 00:18:35.740
Huh?

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:39.110
Lips are a very delicate place, so...

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:41.080
hold still for a bit, please.

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:41.810
Eh...!

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:44.180
Does it hurt?

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:46.400
I'm glad.

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:50.370
Yuuto-san wiped it for me before, so now we're even, right?

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:53.040
Lastly...put this on...

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:56.700
Eh! Is that the one Haruka's been using?

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:57.700
Yes.

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:00.680
Oh, it's difficult to put it on without a mirror, right?

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:01.680
Then...

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:02.420
Oh...

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:07.890
I-isn't this...

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:11.190
an indirect kiss?

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:15.280
Kyah!

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:16.600
Waah!

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:18.100
Ouch...

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:19.840
A-are you okay?

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:21.840
Yeah, I'm o...kay!?

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:28.020
Oh!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:31.110
I-I-I-I'm sorry! I'll get off right away!

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:33.570
N-no, you don't have to rush at all...

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:34.100
Huh?

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:36.580
Uh...! Uh, no... never mind that.

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:38.460
Are you really okay?

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:40.290
Yeah, no problem.

00:19:40.260 --> 00:19:42.110
Kyah! Wah!

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:52.810
Ha-Haruka...

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:04.610
Wah!

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:04.610
Wah!

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:07.510
Um, Yuuto-san, "Fate" is...

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.250
Uh, yeah, I know.

00:20:09.400 --> 00:20:10.500
H-hello?

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:14.060
Yay! Onii-san! How are you and onee-chan doing?

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:18.960
Did you get on the ferris wheel yet? Did you guys kiss like Mika-chan's nice advice said?

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.180
Kyaah~!

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:22.050
So it was Mika's idea!

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:23.450
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:25.020
I just put in the guide...

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:26.600
No, it's okay.

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:27.690
Bye.

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:30.890
Uh, um, what did Mika say?

00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:32.890
No, it wasn't anything important.

00:20:32.890 --> 00:20:33.850
hahaha.

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.980
Isn't it beautiful?

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:45.990
Uh, um, Yuuto-san...

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:46.670
Hm?

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:47.710
Um...

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:52.050
Could I go a little closer to Yuuto-san, please?

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:52.620
Huh?

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:55.340
Oh, I-I'm sorry.

00:20:55.550 --> 00:20:58.690
I know it's a rude request, but...

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.400
I want Yuuto-san closer...

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:02.120
N-no, um...

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:04.120
O-okay.

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:07.140
Th-thank you very much.

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:08.540
mm..

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:09.890
sho...

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.320
huhuhu...

00:21:15.570 --> 00:21:17.320
it's Yuuto-san's scent.

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:18.390
Uh...

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:21.290
Oh...!

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:44.030
This is amazing...

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:46.080
I mean, um...

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:47.250
beautiful.

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:48.900
Oh, no...

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:51.970
But they took such great pictures...

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:54.240
I have to thank Kayahara-san.

00:21:54.240 --> 00:21:58.480
Oh, also, after that day, I saw Kayahara-san many times.

00:21:58.590 --> 00:21:59.090
Huh?

00:21:59.600 --> 00:22:04.280
She came to interview my piano and flower arrangement classes,

00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:06.490
it's such a coincidence.

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:08.290
Coincidence...?

00:22:08.520 --> 00:22:09.880
Really...?

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:11.980
O-onee-chan! You're in trouble!

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:12.910
Mika!

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:14.310
What happened?

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:16.580
What do you mean happened?!

00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:18.590
Look at this! Onii-san, too!

00:22:18.310 --> 00:22:20.310
(Three Piece Production Hosts: Future-Model Audition. Congratulations: Nogizaka Haruka-sama)

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:30.600
Nogizaka Haruka-sama, you have passed our Three Piece Production's Future-Model Idol Audition...

00:22:31.550 --> 00:22:33.170
Says this, Yuuto-san.

00:22:33.380 --> 00:22:34.310
Oh...!

00:22:35.280 --> 00:22:38.460
Hmm...Haruka, an idol...

00:22:38.820 --> 00:22:41.360
Wait, eeh~!? Idol~!!??

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:18.640
(Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals)

00:24:16.140 --> 00:24:18.140
Nogizaka Vocabulary Fundamentals.

00:24:18.140 --> 00:24:19.720
This week, it's "af-reco".

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:25.900
(af-reco)

00:24:19.790 --> 00:24:25.980
It's an abbreviation for "after recording", and it's a job where you put voices onto the images of anime and movies.

00:24:25.900 --> 00:24:34.820
(Next: "It's Gotten Like This...")

00:24:26.100 --> 00:24:28.710
Next is, "It's Gotten Like This..."

00:24:28.710 --> 00:24:31.210
I wonder what it's gotten to be like?

00:24:31.210 --> 00:24:32.650
Please make sure to watch it.

00:24:32.880 --> 00:24:34.300
It's your first priority!

00:24:34.820 --> 00:24:40.400
(See you next week!)

00:24:34.820 --> 00:24:40.400
(Nogizaka Haruka no Himitsu Purezza)
